  "name": "Sylvanas",
  "role": "Ranged Assassin",
  "overview": "Sylvanas is a mobile Ranged Assassin with versatile builds and playstyles that allow her to adapt to many different situations. She has several tools to safely pressure enemies and contribute in fights. However, she is heavily dependent on completing her Black Arrows's Quest to reach full power. Once her main Quest is finished and the game reaches the late game, her damage, self sustain, and mobility are extremely high.",
  "strengths": [
    "Improves the survivability of certain Map Objectives through Haunting Arrows",
    "Excellent waveclear with Unstable Poison",
    "Good pushing power with Possession",
    "Versatile and powerful Heroic Ability choices",
    "Versatile builds with strong single target or AoE damage, mobility, self-sustain and burst or sustained damage",
    "Provides utility through armor reduction and crowd control tools"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Weak early game",
    "Inability to deal selective damage; often stuck having to target what is closest",
    "Low maximum Health; vulnerable to other, more mobile Assassins"
