    "explanation": "Sylvanas is a flexible pick whose build and gameplay versatility allow her to work well with almost any team composition. She excels when allied with Heroes that can reliably pull enemies together or keep them in place with area of effect crowd control, as she can easily burst down grouped enemies in confined spaces with Wailing Arrow and Shadow Dagger. Furthermore, she pairs well with Heroes that can quickly finish off low Health enemies, since her Talent builds can either spread damage across multiple targets or enable the team to swiftly eliminate a single priority target through Mind Control."
  },
