    "explanation": "Haunting Arrows makes Sylvanas especially strong on Maps with lane-pushing Objectives, as it greatly improves her ability to push when her team controls the Objective. Because much of her power comes from completing Black Arrows's quest, she also prefers Maps that promote frequent team fights or offer safe access to enemy Structures, where she can stack by hitting Forts and Keeps or by defending against enemy Objective pushes. By contrast, Maps such as Sky Temple and Blackheart's Bay, which discourage fighting and give few chances to hit Structures, make stacking slow and unreliable for her."
