    {
      "name": "Sustained Damage Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "This Sustained Damage Build utilizes several Talents to accelerate or facilitate the cooldown recovery of Shadow Dagger. By constantly using this ability, Sylvanas can constantly deal high amounts of damage to all enemies during fights.\n\nThis build is particularly effective against enemy compositions with low mobility, as these can be easily kited or hit by Mind Control.\n\nThe primary Heroic choice for this Build is Mind Control. It instantly applies all 3 Black Arrows stacks while also rendering an enemy 100% vulnerable to your attacks. This synergy greatly reduces the cooldown on Shadow Dagger and marks other enemies due to Remorseless, speeding up the Black Arrows quest completion.",
