    {
      "name": "Burst Build",
      "label": "Advanced",
      "description": "This build focuses on maximizing burst damage potential. At Level 13, choose between Windrunner and Cold Embrace. Cold Embrace is better when targeting melee units to maintain safe positioning. For ranged targets, select Windrunner, as you will need to use the second Haunting Wave to reach them.\n\nWhile Wailing Arrow is a great part of your burst damage, Mind Control should not be ignored as an alternative Heroic Ability. Consider picking Mind Control if your main target has no mobility and the enemy team lacks cleanse to counter it. This can create several opportunities to pick off enemies for your team.",
